murder in March 1997."},{"id":"q6","question":"''Wonderwall'' is the signature song of which Manchester band?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Verve","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Blur","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Oasis","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Pulp","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"''Wonderwall'' comes from Oasis''s 1995 album ''(What''s the Story) Morning Glory?''."},{"id":"q7","question":"Which singer released the hit ''Vogue'' in 1990?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Madonna","is_correct":true},{"id":"b","text":"Janet Jackson","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Whitney Houston","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Cher","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"''Vogue'' topped the charts in more than 30 countries and became Madonna''s signature dance track."},{"id":"q8","question":"Which rapper released the double album ''All Eyez on Me'' in 1996?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Snoop Dogg","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Dr. Dre","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Nas","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Tupac Shakur","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"Released months before his death, it was the first solo double album in hip-hop history."}]'::jsonb,
